        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Fragment of the right-hand border of a Persian carpet dating to the late 16th or early 17th century.\nThe beautiful confronting birds are not quite symmetrically positioned within their cartouche and each bird is slightly different.  It indicates that the weaver was working from a sketch - the birds would have been identical if a cartoon had been used."@en ;
